ffshore petroleum regulator for environment and decommissioning has approve=
d an assessment under the new criteria =E2=80=93 this is a decision that mi=
nisters are expected to endorse.&nbsp;</span>
</p><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21p=
